        <details class="modern-details-accordion" style="cursor: pointer; padding: 10px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #e2e8f0;">
          <summary style="font-weight: 700; color: var(--brand-deep-navy); list-style: none; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;">
            <span>日期變更與教練安排規範</span> <span class="arrow-icon" style="font-size: 13px; font-weight: normal;">[ 展開 / 摺疊 ]</span>
          </summary>
          <div style="padding: 12px 8px; color: #5A6A78; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6;">
            如需更改預訂日期，請提前聯繫客服，視教練空檔協助排程。訂課時若未指定教練，由 Life Chill Snow 依學員程度代為挑選最佳教練。
