        </details>
        <details class="modern-details-accordion" style="cursor: pointer; padding: 10px 0;">
          <summary style="font-weight: 700; color: var(--brand-deep-navy); list-style: none; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;">
            <span>天候變更與不可抗力權利宣告</span> <span class="arrow-icon" style="font-size: 13px; font-weight: normal;">[ 展開 / 摺疊 ]</span>
          </summary>
          <div style="padding: 12px 8px; color: #5A6A78; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6;">
            雪況受自然天候影響甚大，遇暴風雪、無雪、雪場因安全因素關閉纜車等不可抗力因素，Life Chill Snow 保有變更當日行程或提供等值替代方案之最終權利。
